"Alan's soul crossed from Earth in his sleep, through a seam another soul's crossing left open."
"That other soul is Ben's; Nala's crossing followed the same unknown current, months later."
"No one sent for Nala, and nothing in this world expects her or knows she came."
"No dead body lay ready for her soul, so the world tree wove her a new one as she crossed."
"The tree wove the body on the likeness of Nala Pike, who drowned in Harrow Brook 26 years ago."
"The name Nala came to her with the body, out of that likeness; she has none of Nala Pike's memories."
"What touched her skin crossed with her; the book on her knee stayed behind on Earth."
"Her crossing let off a mana surge over Harrow Mile at three in the afternoon of day one."
"She lay senseless two hours in the flattened ring of stubble, and woke at five."
"Her System awakened as she crossed, as it awakens for everyone else at fourteen."
"Her status reads: Name: Nala; Tier: 0; Skills: Speed Reading - Lvl 1."
"[Speed Reading] is her innate skill, a Common skill grown from the reader she was."
"At Tier 0 she cannot see her own status; only an assessment tablet or Tier 1 shows it."
"Nothing on her status marks her as from another world, and she has no skinwalker skill."
"An assessment tablet would clear her of being a skinwalker at once."
"Her core is untrained and dormant, like any Tier 0's, with no essence gathered."
"She resonates strongly with water mana and faintly with space mana."
"When she first advances, the Door she meets stands shut."
"Her body is healthy but unused: soft feet, no calluses, untrained muscle."
"She has no kin, no roll entry and no birthplace anywhere in this world."
